### Auth
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_client",
  "password": "pass123"
}

### List Measurements
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/measurements/
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

### Create Measurement
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/measurements/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "profile_name": "Traditional Wear",
    "chest": 40.5,
    "waist": 32.0,
    "inseam": 30.0
}

### Start Conversation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/conversations/start/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "user_id": 2
}

### Send Message
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/messages/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "conversation": 1,
    "content": "Hello, when can I come for fitting?"
}

### Create Transaction (Simulate Paystack/Mobile Money)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "order": 1,
    "amount": 500000,
    "currency": "GNF",
    "status": "pending"
}

### Leave Review
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/reviews/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "tailor": 1,
    "rating": 5,
    "comment": "Best tailor in Conakry!"
}
